ngto). Views: 15; favorites: 7; remixes: 0.\nTags: footer, animated, webgl, threejs, dither, effect, navigation, legal.\n## Overview\nArchival Transit Footer Section is designed for organizing site-wide navigation, legal links, and utility content. Key features include multi-column navigation groups and clear legal pathways. It is suitable for SaaS websites, product marketing pages, and documentation hubs.\n\nManifest Folio ARC-7729104 CDG Paris Charles de Gaulle HND Tokyo Haneda Int. 22 NOV 04K - AT 802 Traveler ELARA V. Embarkation 21:45 Date Nov 22 Portal K4 Priority I Assignment 04K Record: Verified Term 2 → Int Vsl B787…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nFollow the rendered preview for headline scale, supporting copy, navigation density, and component placement.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #8A3324, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #8A3324, background #FFFFFF, surface #A9A293, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse JetBrains Mono for display moments and Newsreader for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Archival Transit Pass</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&family=Newsreader:opsz,wght@6..72,400;6..72,500;6..72,600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <script>\n        tailwind.config = {\n            theme: {\n                extend: {\n                    fontFamily: {\n                        serif: ['Newsreader', 'serif'],\n                        mono: ['JetBrains Mono', 'monospace'],\n                    },\n                    colors: {\n                        brand: {\n                            accent: '#8A3324', // Subdued oxblood\n                            paper: '#EBE6DA', // Warm aged paper\n                            dark: '#0A0A0A',\n                            ink: '#2C2824', // Muted ink\n                            grime: '#A9A293'\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-brand-dark text-brand-ink min-h-screen w-full flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden font-serif selection:bg-brand-accent selection:text-white relative\">\n\n    <!-- Container Lines & Structural Background -->\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none flex justify-between px-8 md:px-24 opacity-20\">\n        <div class=\"w-px h-full border-l border-dashed border-white/30 relative\">\n            <div class=\"absolute top-8 -left-1 w-2 h-2 border border-white/50\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"w-px h-full border-l border-dashed border-white/30\"></div>\n        <div class=\"w-px h-full border-l border-dashed border-white/30\"></div>\n        <div class=\"w-px h-full border-l border-dashed border-white/30 relative\">\n             <div class=\"absolute bottom-8 -left-1 w-2 h-2 border border-white/50\"></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Main Ticket Container with 3D perspective -->\n    <div id=\"scene\" class=\"w-full max-w-6xl p-4 md:p-8 perspective-[2000px] z-10 relative\">\n\n        <!-- Border Gradient Glow -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-accent/20 via-transparent to-white/5 rounded-2xl blur-xl opacity-60 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n        <!-- The Ticket (No Outline, Paper Base) -->\n        <div id=\"ticket\" class=\"w-full bg-brand-paper rounded-xl shadow-[0_40px_80px_-20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.9)] flex flex-col md:flex-row relative overflow-hidden transition-transform duration-200 ease-out\" style=\"transform-style: preserve-3d; --mx: 50%; --my: 50%;\">\n\n            <!-- Layer 1: Fine Archival Paper Grain -->\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.05] pointer-events-none mix-blend-multiply z-0\" style=\"background-image: url('data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox=%220 0 200 200%22 xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22%3E%3Cfilter id=%22noise%22%3E%3CfeTurbulence type=%22fractalNoise%22 baseFrequency=%220.9%22 numOctaves=%224%22 stitchTiles=%22stitch%22/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width=%22100%25%22 height=%22100%25%22 filter=%22url(%23noise)%22/%3E%3C/svg%3E');\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Layer 2: WebGL-style Parallax Dirt & Stains -->\n            <div class=\"absolute -inset-[20%] opacity-[0.15] pointer-events-none mix-blend-color-burn z-0 transition-transform duration-100 ease-out\" style=\"background-image: url('data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox=%220 0 400 400%22 xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22%3E%3Cfilter id=%22dirt%22%3E%3CfeTurbulence type=%22fractalNoise%22 baseFrequency=%220.003%22 numOctaves=%225%22 stitchTiles=%22stitch%22/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width=%22100%25%22 height=%22100%25%22 filter=%22url(%23dirt)%22/%3E%3C/svg%3E'); transform: translate(calc((var(--mx) - 50%) * -0.05), calc((var(--my) - 50%) * -0.05));\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Layer 3: Crease / Wear Shadows -->\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-black/5 via-transparent to-black/5 opacity-50 pointer-events-none z-0\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Layer 4: Interactive Volumetric Glare -->\n            <div id=\"glare\" class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-0 pointer-events-none transition-opacity duration-300 z-50 mix-blend-overlay\" style=\"transform: translateZ(1px); background: radial-gradient(circle at var(--mx) var(--my), rgba(255,255,255,0.7) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 50%);\"></div>\n\n            <!-- LEFT SECTION (Main Pass) -->\n            <div class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col relative z-10\">\n                <div class=\"p-8 md:p-12 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between\">\n\n                    <!-- Header -->\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start w-full mb-12\">\n                        <span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-brand-ink/60 uppercase tracking-widest font-medium\">Manifest Folio</span>\n                        <div class=\"flex gap-4 items-start text-xs font-mono text-brand-ink/50\">\n                            <span>ARC-7729104</span>\n                            <!-- Structural corner marks -->\n                            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-8 opacity-60\">\n                                <div class=\"w-2 h-2 border-t border-l border-brand-accent\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"w-2 h-2 border-t border-r border-brand-accent\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"w-2 h-2 border-b border-l border-brand-accent\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"w-2 h-2 border-b border-r border-brand-accent\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Destinations -->\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between w-full pr-0 md:pr-24 relative\">\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col\">\n                            <span class=\"text-7xl md:text-9xl font-semibold tracking-tighter leading-none text-brand-ink\">CDG</span>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-brand-ink/60 uppercase tracking-widest mt-4\">Paris Charles de Gaulle</span>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-4xl text-brand-accent mx-4 md:mx-0\"></iconify-icon>\n\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col\">\n                            <span class=\"text-7xl md:text-9xl font-semibold tracking-tighter leading-none text-brand-ink\">HND</span>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-brand-ink/60 uppercase tracking-widest mt-4\">Tokyo Haneda Int.</span>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Globe & Vertical Barcode area -->\n                        <div class=\"hidden md:flex flex-col items-end absolute right-0 top-0 h-full\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:global-linear\" class=\"text-4xl text-brand-ink opacity-40 mb-12\"></iconify-icon>\n\n                            <div class=\"flex h-full items-center gap-2\">\n                                <!-- Simulated Vertical Barcode -->\n                                <div class=\"flex h-48 w-12 gap-[2px] opacity-70\">\n                                    <div class=\"w-[3px] h-full bg-brand-ink\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"w-[1px] h-full bg-brand-ink\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"w-[4px] h-full bg-brand-ink\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"w-[2px] h-full bg-brand-ink\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"w-[1px] h-full bg-brand-ink\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"w-[3px] h-full bg-brand-ink\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"w-[1px] h-full bg-brand-ink\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"w-[5px] h-full bg-brand-ink\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"w-[2px] h-full bg-brand-ink\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"w-[1px] h-full bg-brand-ink\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"w-[3px] h-full bg-brand-ink\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"w-[2px] h-full bg-brand-ink\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"w-[4px] h-full bg-brand-ink\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"w-[1px] h-full bg-brand-ink\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"w-[2px] h-full bg-brand-ink\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"w-[3px] h-full bg-brand-ink\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-brand-ink/50 rotate-180\" style=\"writing-mode: vertical-rl;\">22 NOV 04K - AT 802</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Info Grid -->\n                    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-y-10 gap-x-8 mt-16 md:mt-24 w-full md:w-4/5\">\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col\">\n                            <span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-brand-ink/60 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2 border-b border-brand-ink/10 pb-1\">Traveler</span>\n                            <span class=\"text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight text-brand-ink mt-1\">ELARA V.</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col\">\n                            <span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-brand-ink/60 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2 border-b border-brand-ink/10 pb-1\">Embarkation</span>\n                            <span class=\"text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight text-brand-ink mt-1\">21:45</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col\">\n                            <span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-brand-ink/60 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2 border-b border-brand-ink/10 pb-1\">Date</span>\n                            <span class=\"text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight text-brand-ink mt-1\">Nov 22</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col\">\n                            <span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-brand-ink/60 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2 border-b border-brand-ink/10 pb-1\">Portal</span>\n                            <span class=\"text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight text-brand-ink mt-1\">K4</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col\">\n                            <span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-brand-ink/60 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2 border-b border-brand-ink/10 pb-1\">Priority</span>\n                            <span class=\"text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight text-brand-ink mt-1\">I</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col\">\n                            <span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-brand-ink/60 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2 border-b border-brand-ink/10 pb-1\">Assignment</span>\n                            <span class=\"text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight text-brand-ink mt-1\">04K</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Oxblood Bottom Strip -->\n                <div class=\"w-full bg-brand-accent py-3 px-8 md:px-12 flex justify-between items-center text-xs font-mono text-white/80 uppercase tracking-widest relative z-10 border-t border-brand-accent\">\n                    <span>Record: Verified</span>\n                    <span class=\"hidden md:inline\">Term 2 &rarr; Int</span>\n                    <span class=\"hidden md:inline\">Vsl B787-9</span>\n                    <span class=\"hidden md:inline\">Wgt 2PC / 32KG</span>\n                    <span>Logged 18.Nov.2024</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Perforation Divider -->\n            <div class=\"hidden md:flex flex-col justify-center items-center w-8 relative z-20 shrink-0\">\n                <div class=\"h-full w-px border-l-2 border-dashed border-brand-ink/20 absolute left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2\"></div>\n                <!-- Cutouts -->\n                <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-brand-dark absolute top-0 -translate-y-1/2 shadow-inner\"></div>\n                <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-brand-dark absolute bottom-0 translate-y-1/2 shadow-inner\"></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- RIGHT SECTION (Tear-off Slip) -->\n            <div class=\"w-full md:w-80 flex flex-col relative z-10 border-t md:border-t-0 border-dashed border-brand-ink/20\">\n                <div class=\"p-8 md:p-10 flex-1 flex flex-col\">\n\n                    <span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-brand-ink/50 uppercase tracking-widest mb-10 text-right md:text-left w-full\">Archive Copy</span>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start mb-8\">\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col\">\n                            <span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-brand-ink/60 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2 border-b border-brand-ink/10 pb-1\">Traveler</span>\n                            <span class=\"text-xl font-medium tracking-tight text-brand-ink mt-1\">ELARA V.</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"w-6 h-6 rounded-full border-2 border-brand-accent flex items-center justify-center mt-1\">\n                            <div class=\"w-3 h-3 bg-brand-accent rounded-full\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Horizontal Barcode -->\n                    <div class=\"flex w-full h-12 gap-[2px] opacity-70 mb-10\">\n                        <div class=\"w-[2px] h-full bg-brand-ink\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"w-[4px] h-full bg-brand-ink\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"w-[1px] h-full bg-brand-ink\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"w-[3px] h-full bg-brand-ink\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"w-[2px] h-full bg-brand-ink\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"w-[5px] h-full bg-brand-ink\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"w-[1px] h-full bg-brand-ink\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"w-[2px] h-full bg-brand-ink\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"w-[1px] h-full bg-brand-ink\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"w-[4px] h-full bg-brand-ink\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"w-[2px] h-full bg-brand-ink\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"w-[3px] h-full bg-brand-ink\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"w-[1px] h-full bg-brand-ink\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"w-[2px] h-full bg-brand-ink\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"w-[4px] h-full bg-brand-ink\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"w-[1px] h-full bg-brand-ink\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"w-[3px] h-full bg-brand-ink\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"w-[2px] h-full bg-brand-ink\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"w-[1px] h-full bg-brand-ink\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"w-[4px] h-full bg-brand-ink\"></div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-8\">\n                        <span class=\"text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-brand-ink\">CDG</span>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-xl text-brand-accent\"></iconify-icon>\n                        <span class=\"text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-brand-ink\">HND</span>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-6 w-full\">\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between items-end border-b border-brand-ink/10 pb-2\">\n                            <span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-brand-ink/60 uppercase tracking-widest\">Assignment</span>\n                            <span class=\"text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight text-brand-ink\">04K</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between items-end border-b border-brand-ink/10 pb-2\">\n                            <span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-brand-ink/60 uppercase tracking-widest\">Departure</span>\n                            <span class=\"text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight text-brand-ink\">22:30</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Dark Bottom Strip -->\n                <div class=\"w-full bg-[#161412] py-3 px-8 md:px-10 flex justify-between items-center text-xs font-mono text-white/30 uppercase tracking-widest\">\n                    <span>Archival Transit</span>\n                    <span>Vol. 24</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n        const scene = document.getElementById('scene');\n        const ticket = document.getElementById('ticket');\n        const glare = document.getElementById('glare');\n\n        // Interaction logic for WebGL-like 3D feel and material reaction\n        scene.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n            const rect = scene.getBoundingClientRect();\n            const x = e.clientX - rect.left;\n            const y = e.clientY - rect.top;\n\n            // Normalize coordinates from -1 to 1\n            const xNorm = (x / rect.width) * 2 - 1;\n            const yNorm = (y / rect.height) * 2 - 1;\n\n            // Maximum rotation in degrees\n            const maxRotateX = 5;\n            const maxRotateY = 5;\n\n            // Calculate rotation\n            const rotateX = yNorm * -maxRotateX;\n            const rotateY = xNorm * maxRotateY;\n\n            // Apply transform to ticket\n            ticket.style.transform = `rotateX(${rotateX}deg) rotateY(${rotateY}deg)`;\n\n            // Update CSS variables for shader-like dirt parallax and dynamic glare\n            const mouseXPercent = (x / rect.width) * 100;\n            const mouseYPercent = (y / rect.height) * 100;\n            ticket.style.setProperty('--mx', `${mouseXPercent}%`);\n            ticket.style.setProperty('--my', `${mouseYPercent}%`);\n\n            glare.style.opacity = '1';\n        });\n\n        scene.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => {\n            // Reset to default on mouse leave\n            ticket.style.transform = 'rotateX(0deg) rotateY(0deg)';\n            ticket.style.setProperty('--mx', `50%`);\n            ticket.style.setProperty('--my', `50%`);\n            glare.style.opacity = '0';\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "archival-transit-pass.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/archival-transit-pass.jpg", "source_name": "archival-transit-pass-DESIGN.md", "views": 122, "forks": 6, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-06-30T09:32:59.952022+00:00"}